<title>POLAND: NBP SELLS PLN 393 MLN OF 273-DAY NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>NBP SELLS PLN 393 MLN OF 273-DAY NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland sold 393 million zlotys of its 273-day NBP-bills after banks bid for 402 million zlotys worth of the bills against the central bank's 400 million zloty offer, the NBP said.</p>
<p>The bank sold the paper at an unchanged average yield of 22.00 percent.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
</text>
